 "purpose": "The topics of mental arithmetic: times tables, plus and minus with strategies, x and : by 10/100/1000, doubling and halving, and clever x and : by splitting.",
 "details": "Five Onderwerp subclasses, one shared cheat sheet (SPIEKBRIEF, returned by each topic's spiekbrief method). Each question carries a strategy that the explanation shows step by step (compensate, split, double ...). Tafels (with extension 7 x 80, division and negatives), PlusMin (compensate near-round numbers or split the second number; the klad is on), MaalDeel10 (the comma shifts), DubbelHelft (double and half by splitting) and Splitsen (91 : 7 as 70 : 7 + 21 : 7, or 99 x 6 by compensating; the klad is required and klad_klaar checks that a split is visible). The topics give worked solutions (oplossing) as klad lines with known wrong paths. The kinds of this file (TAFELS, PLUSMIN, DUBBELHELFT) are also the sources of the speed-practice questions (kern/snelrekenen.py). Note: _plaats ignores its first parameter.",
 "module_docstring": "Hoofdrekenen: tafels, optellen en aftrekken, × en : met 10/100/1000, verdubbelen en halveren, slim × en : (splitsen).",
